<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Celebrity Deathmatch"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="fakemink"/><amll:meta key="album" value="London&apos;s Saviour"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QZWFQ2381530"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2747218679"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000jYnRt2P2diO"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1824182207"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="6ssdWlKzO4GWp5ogTcd6rZ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="255545833"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="kalve7n"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Tina Temps</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:52.779"><div begin="9.314" end="2:52.779"><p begin="9.314" end="11.572" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.314" end="9.562">I&apos;ma</span> <span begin="9.562" end="9.806">crush</span> <span begin="9.806" end="9.999">into</span> <span begin="9.999" end="10.157">the</span> <span begin="10.157" end="10.507">game</span> <span begin="10.507" end="10.659">like</span> <span begin="10.659" end="10.847">a</span> <span begin="10.847" end="11.572">meteor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哥会像流星一样炸翻这场游戏</span></p><p begin="11.705" end="13.938" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.705" end="11.875">Like</span> <span begin="11.875" end="12.007">a</span> <span begin="12.007" end="12.598">Christian</span> <span begin="12.598" end="12.843">man,</span> <span begin="12.843" end="13.014">yeah,</span> <span begin="13.014" end="13.274">I</span> <span begin="13.274" end="13.523">need</span> <span begin="13.523" end="13.938">Dior</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对迪奥的欲望 不亚于基督徒对神的信仰</span></p><p begin="13.907" end="16.349" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.907" end="14.021">I</span> <span begin="14.021" end="14.376">sing</span> <span begin="14.376" end="14.650">well</span> <span begin="14.650" end="14.777">in</span> <span begin="14.777" end="15.290">Celine,</span> <span begin="15.290" end="15.454">like</span> <span begin="15.454" end="15.897">Celine</span> <span begin="15.897" end="16.349">Dion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿着Celine唱歌自带Celine Dion属性</span></p><p begin="16.505" end="18.763" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.505" end="16.604">And</span> <span begin="16.604" end="16.790">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="16.790" end="17.110">clingin&apos;</span> <span begin="17.110" end="17.268">to</span> <span begin="17.268" end="17.413">the</span> <span begin="17.413" end="17.711">money,</span> <span begin="17.711" end="17.894">like</span> <span begin="17.894" end="18.027">a</span> <span begin="18.027" end="18.499">needy</span> <span begin="18.499" end="18.763">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从不装清高 我就是爱钱</span></p><p begin="19.022" end="21.243" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.022" end="19.230">Where</span> <span begin="19.230" end="19.326">did</span> <span begin="19.326" end="19.476">the</span> <span begin="19.476" end="19.823">time</span> <span begin="19.823" end="20.108">go?</span> <span begin="20.108" end="20.274">Man,</span> <span begin="20.274" end="20.394">it</span> <span begin="20.394" end="20.702">feels</span> <span begin="20.702" end="20.877">like</span> <span begin="20.877" end="21.243">forever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这段时间仿佛熬穿了半个世纪</span></p><p begin="21.271" end="23.738" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.271" end="21.502">If</span> <span begin="21.502" end="21.566">I</span> <span begin="21.566" end="21.892">ever</span> <span begin="21.892" end="22.073">take</span> <span begin="22.073" end="22.208">a</span> <span begin="22.208" end="22.487">break,</span> <span begin="22.487" end="22.618">know</span> <span begin="22.618" end="22.804">I</span> <span begin="22.804" end="23.117">come</span> <span begin="23.117" end="23.354">back</span> <span begin="23.354" end="23.738">better</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我给自己放个短假 那你要知道 我是在憋大招</span></p><p begin="23.785" end="26.124" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.785" end="24.012">Two</span> <span begin="24.012" end="24.325">dogs,</span> <span begin="24.325" end="24.576">one</span> <span begin="24.576" end="24.897">white,</span> <span begin="24.897" end="25.141">black,</span> <span begin="25.141" end="25.451">salt</span> <span begin="25.451" end="25.769">and</span> <span begin="25.769" end="26.124">pepper</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双犬相伴 一白一黑 如盐混胡椒</span></p><p begin="26.338" end="28.512" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.338" end="26.413">I</span> <span begin="26.413" end="26.565">made</span> <span begin="26.565" end="26.664">the</span> <span begin="26.664" end="27.000">money</span> <span begin="27.000" end="27.311">cheat,</span> <span begin="27.311" end="27.550">bitch,</span> <span begin="27.550" end="27.869">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="27.869" end="28.512">homewrecker</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我靠着搅黄别人感情捞钱</span></p><p begin="28.527" end="30.907" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.527" end="28.663">But</span> <span begin="28.663" end="28.810">the</span> <span begin="28.810" end="29.022">money</span> <span begin="29.022" end="29.286">never</span> <span begin="29.286" end="29.747">stays,</span> <span begin="29.747" end="29.803">know</span> <span begin="29.803" end="29.915">that</span> <span begin="29.915" end="30.069">I</span> <span begin="30.069" end="30.299">could</span> <span begin="30.299" end="30.574">do</span> <span begin="30.574" end="30.907">better</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过这行干不久 老子早晚能逆袭</span></p><p begin="31.079" end="33.270" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.079" end="31.201">She</span> <span begin="31.201" end="31.360">ask</span> <span begin="31.360" end="31.498">me</span> <span begin="31.498" end="31.603">when</span> <span begin="31.603" end="31.764">I</span> <span begin="31.764" end="32.094">win,</span> <span begin="32.094" end="32.194">I</span> <span begin="32.194" end="32.709">reply,</span> <span begin="32.709" end="32.998">&quot;Like,</span> <span begin="32.998" end="33.270">never&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她问我何时能翻身 老实说 也许梦里</span></p><p begin="33.631" end="35.737" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.631" end="33.970">Hedi</span> <span begin="34.070" end="34.488">Slimane</span> <span begin="34.488" end="34.606">on</span> <span begin="34.606" end="34.828">my</span> <span begin="34.828" end="35.108">back,</span> <span begin="35.108" end="35.370">black</span> <span begin="35.370" end="35.737">lether</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿着Hedi Slimane的黑色皮衣</span></p><p begin="35.848" end="38.159" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.848" end="35.947">I</span> <span begin="35.947" end="36.133">said,</span> <span begin="36.133" end="36.269">&quot;I&apos;d</span> <span begin="36.269" end="36.571">never</span> <span begin="36.571" end="36.904">change&quot;,</span> <span begin="36.904" end="37.016">but</span> <span begin="37.016" end="37.155">I</span> <span begin="37.155" end="37.393">never</span> <span begin="37.393" end="37.776">say</span> <span begin="37.776" end="38.159">never</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾说过初心不变 却从不会妄下断言</span></p><p begin="37.806" end="42.345" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="37.806" end="37.920">I</span> <span begin="37.920" end="38.064">could</span> <span begin="38.064" end="38.334">go</span> <span begin="38.334" end="38.897">home</span> <span begin="39.025" end="39.153">to</span> <span begin="39.153" end="39.420">my</span> <span begin="39.420" end="39.916">love</span> <span begin="40.003" end="40.134">and</span> <span begin="40.134" end="40.467">live</span> <span begin="40.467" end="40.649">the</span> <span begin="40.649" end="41.209">life</span> <span begin="41.209" end="41.392">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="41.392" end="41.841">always</span> <span begin="41.841" end="42.345">wanted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我可与挚爱共度理想生活</span></p><p begin="42.345" end="47.257" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="42.345" end="42.503">Or</span> <span begin="42.503" end="42.648">I</span> <span begin="42.648" end="42.891">could</span> <span begin="42.891" end="43.229">go</span> <span begin="43.229" end="43.576">on</span> <span begin="43.837" end="44.303">runnin&apos;</span> <span begin="44.303" end="44.738">off</span> <span begin="44.863" end="45.324">into</span> <span begin="45.324" end="45.450">the</span> <span begin="45.450" end="46.083">night,</span> <span begin="46.083" end="46.485">lonely</span> <span begin="46.485" end="46.651">and</span> <span begin="46.651" end="47.257">haunted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或者继续在黑夜中游荡 与孤魂作伴</span></p><p begin="47.660" end="51.940" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="47.660" end="47.813">And</span> <span begin="47.813" end="47.970">the</span> <span begin="47.970" end="48.611">strange</span> <span begin="48.611" end="48.880">thing</span> <span begin="48.880" end="49.548">is,</span> <span begin="49.631" end="49.796">I</span> <span begin="49.796" end="50.073">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="50.073" end="50.369">know</span> <span begin="50.369" end="50.834">which</span> <span begin="50.834" end="51.323">I</span> <span begin="51.323" end="51.940">prefer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但奇怪的是 我竟然难以抉择</span></p><p begin="52.356" end="57.334" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="52.356" end="52.518">As</span> <span begin="52.518" end="52.669">I</span> <span begin="52.669" end="52.977">sit</span> <span begin="52.977" end="53.287">here</span> <span begin="53.287" end="53.411">and</span> <span begin="53.411" end="53.657">watch</span> <span begin="53.657" end="53.872">the</span> <span begin="53.872" end="54.102">sun</span> <span begin="54.102" end="54.445">set</span> <span begin="54.445" end="54.592">on</span> <span begin="54.592" end="55.051">Sacré-</span><span begin="55.051" end="55.581">Cœur-</span><span begin="55.808" end="56.165">Cœur-</span><span begin="56.396" end="56.762">Cœur-</span><span begin="56.981" end="57.334">Cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能望着被暮色漫染的的圣心教堂 独坐放空</span></p><p begin="57.368" end="58.416" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.368" end="57.609">I&apos;ma</span> <span begin="57.609" end="57.800">die</span> <span begin="57.800" end="57.918">a</span> <span begin="57.918" end="58.416">martyr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿慷慨赴死</span></p><p begin="58.571" end="1:00.838" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.571" end="58.708">No,</span> <span begin="58.708" end="58.824">I</span> <span begin="58.824" end="58.948">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="58.948" end="59.158">the</span> <span begin="59.158" end="59.406">devil,</span> <span begin="59.406" end="59.543">but</span> <span begin="59.543" end="59.655">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="59.655" end="1:00.058">still</span> <span begin="1:00.058" end="1:00.343">wearin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:00.343" end="1:00.838">Prada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是个爱穿Prada的假魔头(致敬电影«The Devil Wears Prada»)</span></p><p begin="1:00.971" end="1:03.229" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.971" end="1:01.085">If</span> <span begin="1:01.085" end="1:01.186">you</span> <span begin="1:01.186" end="1:01.479">ever</span> <span begin="1:01.479" end="1:01.802">go</span> <span begin="1:01.802" end="1:02.131">hard,</span> <span begin="1:02.131" end="1:02.261">know</span> <span begin="1:02.261" end="1:02.435">I</span> <span begin="1:02.435" end="1:02.726">go</span> <span begin="1:02.726" end="1:03.229">harder</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要是敢玩命 我只会比你更疯</span></p><p begin="1:03.376" end="1:05.624" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.376" end="1:03.461">Yeah,</span> <span begin="1:03.461" end="1:03.565">I</span> <span begin="1:03.565" end="1:03.868">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:03.868" end="1:04.066">own</span> <span begin="1:04.066" end="1:04.227">a</span> <span begin="1:04.227" end="1:04.497">jet,</span> <span begin="1:04.497" end="1:04.605">but</span> <span begin="1:04.605" end="1:04.838">I</span> <span begin="1:04.838" end="1:05.061">do</span> <span begin="1:05.061" end="1:05.624">charter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没私人飞机那就包机</span></p><p begin="1:05.760" end="1:09.397" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.760" end="1:05.849">Yeah,</span> <span begin="1:05.849" end="1:06.013">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:06.013" end="1:06.298">chillin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:06.298" end="1:06.464">in</span> <span begin="1:06.464" end="1:06.563">the</span> <span begin="1:06.563" end="1:06.974">sky,</span> <span begin="1:06.974" end="1:07.205">no</span> <span begin="1:07.205" end="1:07.619">lights</span> <span begin="1:07.619" end="1:07.876">on,</span> <span begin="1:07.876" end="1:07.971">but</span> <span begin="1:07.971" end="1:08.087">you</span> <span begin="1:08.087" end="1:08.283">see</span> <span begin="1:08.283" end="1:08.429">a</span> <span begin="1:08.429" end="1:08.733">light</span> <span begin="1:08.733" end="1:08.896">in</span> <span begin="1:08.896" end="1:09.029">my</span> <span begin="1:09.029" end="1:09.397">eye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使身处舒适黑暗的环境 你仍能看见我眼中的光</span></p><p begin="1:09.626" end="1:11.872" itunes:key="L2