 end="2:19.760">here</span> <span begin="2:19.760" end="2:19.904">and</span> <span begin="2:19.904" end="2:20.160">watch</span> <span begin="2:20.160" end="2:20.338">the</span> <span begin="2:20.338" end="2:20.628">sun</span> <span begin="2:20.628" end="2:20.975">set</span> <span begin="2:20.975" end="2:21.140">on</span> <span begin="2:21.140" end="2:21.584">Sacré-</span><span begin="2:21.584" end="2:21.907">Cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能望着被暮色漫染的的圣心教堂 独坐放空</span></p><p begin="2:24.114" end="2:26.291" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.114" end="2:24.258">Said</span> <span begin="2:24.258" end="2:24.431">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="2:24.431" end="2:24.642">never</span> <span begin="2:24.642" end="2:25.037">change,</span> <span begin="2:25.037" end="2:25.159">but</span> <span begin="2:25.159" end="2:25.291">I</span> <span begin="2:25.291" end="2:25.536">never</span> <span begin="2:25.536" end="2:25.939">say</span> <span begin="2:25.939" end="2:26.291">never</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾说过初心不变 却从不会妄下断言</span></p><p begin="2:26.504" end="2:28.745" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.504" end="2:26.646">Said</span> <span begin="2:26.646" end="2:26.829">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="2:26.829" end="2:27.113">never</span> <span begin="2:27.113" end="2:27.451">change,</span> <span begin="2:27.451" end="2:27.575">but</span> <span begin="2:27.575" end="2:27.737">I</span> <span begin="2:27.737" end="2:27.949">never</span> <span begin="2:27.949" end="2:28.321">say</span> <span begin="2:28.321" end="2:28.745">never</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾说过初心不变 却从不会妄下断言</span></p><p begin="2:28.920" end="2:31.210" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.920" end="2:29.063">Said</span> <span begin="2:29.063" end="2:29.235">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="2:29.235" end="2:29.522">never</span> <span begin="2:29.522" end="2:29.857">change,</span> <span begin="2:29.857" 